				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Echo): Standardize CHANGELOG formatting and whitespace\n\nRefactor the CHANGELOG.md file to remove legacy line-break artifacts and ensure consistent line wrapping across all version history entries. The diff shows a reformatting of the entire document to align with standard markdown presentation while preserving the narrative of Echo's evolution from a Cloudflare Workers scaffold to the high-performance Rust work-stealing scheduler.\n\nThis cleanup ensures the documentation remains readable and consistent with the project's strict formatting standards, facilitating better maintainability as the version history grows.",
			"SHA": "d560fb4b82e2081385fef5a7eb12b44caaba012a"
		},
